      "durationMs": 8250,
      "key": "6723d1aa2f63f3b1"
    },
    {
      "text": "40 vehicles, and we would want driver behaviour scoring as well as tracking.",
      "file": "audio/conv-03-visitor.mp3",
      "durationMs": 5250,
      "key": "cad0cfc697980600"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a 90 day notice period before March, so it is tighter than it looks.",
